# I18n and Copy
- Do not hardcode reusable user-visible text in public components.
- Use typed locale keys for built-in labels, empty/loading states, validation text and accessibility labels.
- Locale packs must remain structurally synchronized.
- Prefer compile-time completeness (`satisfies`) where applicable.
- Do not couple document `dir` to locale selection; reading direction is an independent runtime switch (`LocaleService.setDirection` / `?dir=`).
